.4207 50.2529 43.8119 51.2376 43.8119Z"/></svg>Foldhealth</a><span class="fh-card" aria-hidden="true"><span class="fh-frame-wrap"><iframe class="fh-frame" title="fold.health website preview" loading="lazy" scrolling="no" tabindex="-1" data-fh-frame></iframe></span></span></span> building
          the framework for primary and chronic healthcare. I care deeply about craft and quality and I like to make people feel something through
          my work.
        </div>
        <div class="bio">
          Previously, I worked at <span class="bc-wrap" data-bc-link><a class="bc-pill-link" href="https://banyancloud.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg class="bc-pill-logo" width="12" height="15" viewBox="0 0 12 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.3017 9.18022H9.09683C9.00685 9.18022 8.93349 9.25072 8.92861 9.3407C8.82287 11.3902 6.78479 12.9285 4.60086 12.1688C3.73313 11.8671 3.04622 11.1799 2.74475 10.3122C1.965 8.06977 3.60876 5.98068 5.74054 5.98068C5.74283 5.98068 5.74512 5.98068 5.74742 5.98068V3.61134C5.74742 3.51591 5.66832 3.43968 5.5729 3.44255C4.44726 3.47493 3.40329 3.83199 2.5304 4.4229V0H0V9.14211H0.00802388C0.0051582 9.69862 0.0808122 10.2735 0.247022 10.8566C0.770869 12.6947 2.21718 14.1419 4.05523 14.6663C7.8792 15.7575 11.3579 12.9807 11.4708 9.35531C11.4736 9.2596 11.3974 9.18022 11.302 9.18022H11.3017Z" fill="url(#paint0_linear_431_9827)"/><path d="M8.67555 8.85667C8.74003 8.92115 8.85064 8.88475 8.86382 8.79449L9.31058 5.77234C9.32147 5.69869 9.25814 5.63535 9.18449 5.64624L6.16234 6.093C6.07207 6.10647 6.03539 6.2168 6.10016 6.28128L8.67584 8.85696L8.67555 8.85667Z" fill="url(#paint1_linear_431_9827)"/><path d="M10.6761 6.85918C10.74 6.92308 10.8492 6.88697 10.8626 6.79756L11.31 3.7714C11.3209 3.69861 11.2581 3.63585 11.1853 3.64674L8.15915 4.09408C8.06974 4.10726 8.03363 4.21673 8.09754 4.28063L10.6764 6.85946L10.6761 6.85918Z" fill="url(#paint2_linear_431_9827)"/><defs><linearGradient id="paint0_linear_431_9827" x1="11.9321" y1="0.212347" x2="-1.14914" y2="12.123" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#FF1597"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FF892A"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="paint1_linear_431_9827" x1="13.5312" y1="1.96814" x2="0.449885" y2="13.8785" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#FF1597"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FF892A"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="paint2_linear_431_9827" x1="13.442" y1="1.8703" x2="0.36076" y2="13.7807" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#FF1597"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FF892A"/></linearGradient></defs></svg><span class="bc-pill-banyan">Banyan</span><span class="bc-pill-cloud">Cloud</span></a><span class="bc-card" aria-hidden="true"><span class="bc-frame-wrap"><img class="bc-frame" src="/banyan-cloud-preview.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span></span></span>, as the founding
          designer and built a holistic cyber security platform from scratch. You
          can reach me at <span class="x-wrap"><a class="bio-link" href="https://x.com/designedbyalok" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@designedbyalok</a><span class="x-hover-card" aria-hidden="true"><XProfileCard /></span></span> and via
          <a class="bio-link" href="mailto:designedbyalok@gmail.com">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M3 8l9 6 9-6"></path></svg>
            email</a> or see my code on
          <span class="gh-wrap"><a class="bio-link" href="https://github.com/designedbyalok" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"></path></svg>
            GitHub</a><span class="gh-hover-card" aria-hidden="true"><GithubHeatmap card /></span></span>.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Projects -->
      <section class="block animate a4">
        <h2 class="block-label">Projects</h2>
        <div class="project-grid">
          {
            projects.map((p) => (
              <a
                class="project-card"
                href={p.href}
                target={p.external ? "_blank" : undefined}
                rel={p.external ? "noopener noreferrer" : undefined}
              >
                <div class="project-card-inner">
                  <div class="project-icon">
                    <img src={p.icon} alt="" width="56" height="56" loading="lazy" />
                  </div>
                  <div class="project-meta">
                    <span class="project-title">
                      {p.title}
                      <span class="project-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="project-sub">{p.sub}</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </a>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Writing + Resources share one blur scope: hovering an item
           blurs siblings across both sections, not just within one. -->
      <div class="blur-scope">
        <!-- Writing — same listing as the blog index -->
        <section class="block animate a5">
          <h2 class="block-label">Writing</h2>
          <div class="blur-list">
            {
              posts.map((post) => (
                <a class="blur-item" href={`/blog/${post.slug}`} data-astro-prefetch="hover">
                  <div class="blur-item-left">
                    {post.thumbnail ? (
                      <img class="thumb-frame" src={post.thumbnail} alt="" width="64" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    ) : (
                      <div class="thumb-frame" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                    )}
                    <span class="blur-item-title">{post.title}</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="blur-item-meta">{fmtDate(post.date)}</span>
                </a>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Resources -->
        <section class="block animate a6">
          <h2 class="block-label">Resources</h2>
          <div class="row-list">
            {
              resources.map((r) => (
                <a class="row" href={r.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                  <span class="res-thumb" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="res-line"></span>
                    <span class="res-line"></span>
                    <span class="res-line"></span>
                    <span class="res-bar"></span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="row-text">
                    <span class="row-title">{r.title}</span>
                    <span class="row-meta">{r.sub}</span>
                  </span>
                </a>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- Follow me -->
      <section class="block follow animate a7">
        <h2 class="block-label center">Follow me</h2>
        <div class="socials">
          <a class="social" href="https://x.com/designedbyalok" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="X (Twitter)">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4l11.733 16h4.267l-11.733 -16z"/><path d="M4 20l6.768 -6.768m2.46 -2.46l6.772 -6.772"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="social" href="https://www.instagram.com/designedbyalok" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"></rect><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"></line></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="social" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/designedbyalok/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LinkedIn">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"></path><rect x="2" y="9" width="4" height="12"></rect><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"></circle></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="social" href="https://dribbble.com/designedbyalok" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Dribbble">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M8.56 2.75c4.37 6.03 6.02 9.42 8.03 17.72m2.54-15.38c-3.72 4.35-8.94 5.66-16.88 5.85m19.5 1.9c-3.5-.93-6.65-.53-13.94 8.6"></path></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="social" href="https://github.com/designedbyalok" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <footer class="home-footer animate a8">
        <span class="footer-handle">@designedbyalok</span>
        <img class="footer-sign" src="/signature.svg" alt="Alok signature" width="100" height="41" loading="lazy" />
      </footer>
    </div>

    <NowWorking
      title={nowWorking.title}
      sub={nowWorking.sub}
      href={nowWorking.href}
      icon={nowWorking.icon}
    />
    <NowPlaying />
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .home {
    /* Web: logo + toggle pinned to the edges with 48px sides, 80px top/bottom.
       The fixed chrome reads these via --chrome-* so it aligns with content. */
    --chrome-top: 80px;
    --chrome-side: 48px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 80px 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .home-col {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 632px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  /* Portrait — first content, aligned to the top with the fixed logo */
  .portrait-frame {
    width: 198px;
    height: 232px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 2px solid var(--thumb-border);
    background: var(--tag-bg);
  }
  .portrait-frame img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 18%;
    display: block;
  }

  /* Intro */
  .intro {
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  .home-name {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 30px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .home-name-link {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: text-decoration-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .home-name-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--border);
    text-underline-offset: 5px;
  }
  .home-role {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--fg-secondary);
  }
  .bio {
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.625;
    color: var(--fg-secondary);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .bio strong {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .bio em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .bio-link {
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--border);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .bio-link svg {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: -2px;
    margin-right: 3px;
  }
  .bio-link:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--fg);
  }

  /* Foldhealth — inline purple pill + live website-render hover card.
     Wrapper holds the link AND the absolutely-positioned card as siblings,
     so the iframe is never nested inside the <a> (invalid HTML that the
     parser would otherwise "recover" from by wrapping later content). */
  .fh-wrap {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    vertical-align: baseline;
  }
  .fh-pill-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 1px 6px 2px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }
  /* Inline SVG inherits color via fill="currentColor", so the icon
     follows the pill's text color in both states — no filter hack. */
  .fh-pill-logo {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .fh-pill-link:hover {
    background: #8c5ae2;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .fh-card {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: calc(100% + 8px);
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(6px) scale(0.96);
    transform-origin: bottom center;
    width: 244px;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
    z-index: 60;
  }
  .fh-wrap:hover .fh-card,
  .fh-wrap:focus-within .fh-card {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0) scale(1);
  }
  .fh-frame-wrap {
    display: block;
    width: 244px;
    height: 320px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 4px solid var(--thumb-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
